{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"d2e9bbef8fa77436","name":"card_event_order_of_the_day","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Finland/events/card_event_order_of_the_day","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"ORDER OF THE DAY","text":"Add two SISSI units to the support line. Your SISSI get: \"It costs the enemy +1 kredits to target or attack this unit.\"","flavorText":"The Sword Scabbard Declaration was a speech made by Finnish Commander-in-Chief Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim on July 23rd, 1941, during WWII. At the time, Finland was engaged in the Continuation War against the Soviet Union in an effort to reclaim territories lost to the USSR in the Winter War of 1939-1940. In his speech, Mannerheim declared that he would not \"sheathe his sword\" until Finland had reclaimed all lost lands. The speech became symbolic and rallied the Finnish people to support the war effort, and it remains one of Mannerheim’s most famous wartime statements.","faction":"Finland","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":3,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_order_of_the_day","title":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_order_of_the_day_title","SourceString":"ORDER OF THE DAY","LocalizedString":"ORDER OF THE DAY"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Finland","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_order_of_the_day_text","SourceString":"Add two SISSI units to the support line. Your SISSI get: \"It costs the enemy +1 kredits to target or attack this unit.\"","LocalizedString":"Add two SISSI units to the support line. Your SISSI get: \"It costs the enemy +1 kredits to target or attack this unit.\""},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_order_of_the_day_history","SourceString":"The Sword Scabbard Declaration was a speech made by Finnish Commander-in-Chief Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim on July 23rd, 1941, during WWII. At the time, Finland was engaged in the Continuation War against the Soviet Union in an effort to reclaim territories lost to the USSR in the Winter War of 1939-1940. In his speech, Mannerheim declared that he would not \"sheathe his sword\" until Finland had reclaimed all lost lands. The speech became symbolic and rallied the Finnish people to support the war effort, and it remains one of Mannerheim’s most famous wartime statements.","LocalizedString":"The Sword Scabbard Declaration was a speech made by Finnish Commander-in-Chief Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim on July 23rd, 1941, during WWII. At the time, Finland was engaged in the Continuation War against the Soviet Union in an effort to reclaim territories lost to the USSR in the Winter War of 1939-1940. In his speech, Mannerheim declared that he would not \"sheathe his sword\" until Finland had reclaimed all lost lands. The speech became symbolic and rallied the Finnish people to support the war effort, and it remains one of Mannerheim’s most famous wartime statements."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BloodAndIron","spawnCardName":"card_unit_sissi","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Finland/Winter_2024/t_order_of_the_day.t_order_of_the_day","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Look and Learn","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/ORDER_OF_THE_DAY.ORDER_OF_THE_DAY","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":336.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_order_of_the_day_photo","SourceString":"Marshal of Finland Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim in 1942.","LocalizedString":"Marshal of Finland Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim in 1942."},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackOrder.BP_AttackOrder_C","SubPathString":""}},"variables":[],"funct